# Interface design

Read and follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and the canonical [DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md) first. It defines the Start Kit's themable identity on top of the validated shell composition; preserve that composition and the Start Kit business scope. For requested interface work, consult the [frontend design skill](../../.agents/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md) and relevant component documentation. Generic skill preferences do not replace the approved visual reference.

Preserve the existing components, theme, typography, spacing, and interaction patterns for scoped fixes. Apply a new visual direction when the user requests design work, within that scope. Keep responsive layouts, light/dark behavior, accessible focus and contrast, and clear loading/error feedback. Use motion proportionally and respect reduced motion.
